ic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to live chat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to communicate in real time via the internet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am live chatting thanks to the on-board WiFi."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about social media."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on-board WiFi"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wireless internet available on a train, plane or bus."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am live chatting thanks to the on-board WiFi."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ETA"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "estimated time of arrival "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Mom knows my ETA thanks to Facebook."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pick up on "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give \u200bparticular \u200battention to something that someone has said or done"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hope everyone is picking up on the news that I'll be there in a few short hours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "under the table"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "done in secret "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She'll be happy to see me and give me some money under the table. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gravy train"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "easy way of making money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "skype"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an \u200bapplication for \u200bcommunicating via the internet using \u200bvideo or \u200bvoice \u200bcalls"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I sometime wonder why we all like to Facebook, tweet and Skype so much."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "screen time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "time spent communicating via a computer"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Face to face screen time is so much better. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "social media "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "various \u200bprograms that \u200ballow \u200bpeople to \u200bcommunicate and \u200bshare \u200binformation on the internet "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I just love being connected and thanks to social media, I am! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob05aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le16ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Other Ways of Referring to the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Present to express formal arrangements or dates in the future.<br/>You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">about to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">on the point of</span> to express events in the immediate future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the  Present Simple to refer to future time actions in future time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">When I get there, we'll talk.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present Simple is also used to describe fixed events that have a clear indication of date and time. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">She retires next year.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You also use the Present Simple with various expressions.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Be about to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">be on the point of</span>, <span class=\"italic\">be due to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">just</span>/<span class=\"italic\">just about to</span> refer to a moment in the future that is very close."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">The train is on the point of leaving but I am live chatting thanks to the on-board WiFi.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The train is on the point of leaving but I am live chatting thanks to the on-board WiFi."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I expect dinner will be on the table when arrive."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Possibility"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the first conditional with If clauses to exchange opinions about possible future outcomes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will or will not do something. In that condition, something else may, may not will or will not happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">Condition</span> clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Present Simple/Present Perfect ... <span class=\"italic\">will</span> / Present Continuous / <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If I find a minute, I'm uploading the latest pictures.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I take more this weekend, I'm putting them up on my way home. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I haven't checked in for more than an hour, my friends are going to figure something happened to me! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I mean, if they haven't been around, I'm worrying about them! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If get a new bigger phone this year, doing this will be even easier."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write several sentences on the good points and bad points of using social media. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Come up with 6 points for each side."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Back up each idea with each an example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice giving your opinions with the backup example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk with a group and exchange ideas, taking turns."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Follow up on any statements you find interesting."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write several sentences on the good points and points of using social media. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I back up each idea with each an example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice giving my opinions with the backup example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I exchange opinions with a partner or group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I comment further on interesting statements."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "In days past, I used to hear my mother say 'When I get there, we'll talk'. That doesn't really happen anymore. My trip home is just beginning and already I'm planning my weekend. The train is on the point of leaving but I am live chatting thanks to the on-board WiFi. I hope everyone is picking up on the news that I'll be there in a few short hours.", "id": 1, "time": "50", "image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I expect dinner will be on the table when I arrive. Mom knows my ETA thanks to Facebook. I don't doubt Gram shall arrive with her newest boyfriend in tow, I e-mail her regularly. She'll be happy to see me and give me some money under the table. She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!\n<br>\nIf I find a minute, I'm uploading latest pictures. If I take more this weekend, I'm putting them up on my way home. I'm tweeting everyone now. If I haven't checked in for more than an hour, my friends are going to figure something happened to me! I mean, if they haven't been around, I'm worrying about them! If get a new, bigger phone this year, doing this will be even easier.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "I sometimes wonder why we all like to Facebook, tweet and Skype so much. I guess we just like gabbing. Of course I also find being away at college a bit lonely. Face to face screen time is so much better. I feel like nothing's changed, you know?\n<br>\nGram says she used to write letters to all her friends - on paper - in the mail - with stamps! Isn't that insane!\n<br>\nI like keeping up to date too. The breaking news is always there. I get Twitter feed all the time. I just love being connected and thanks to social media, I am!", "id": 3, "time": "60000", "image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about technology and personal dilemmas."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express something that may be possible."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How often do you post online?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How many people do you connect with this way?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How much do you rely on internet exchanges to keep you up to date with your friends?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content":